            "Actual injury settlement owns wound/blood projections but never writes CharacterTime; caller commits returned elapsed once. This rejects a double-clock-write suspicion for the native surgery body. Fracture projection stays within bruising, splint provenance quantity1 and exactinventoryrow retained.",
            "Treatment align824..883 previews common disease/injury boundary and executes every participant via non-short-circuit &= over common safe duration, self treatment one participant; unlike separatelydiscarded-advance callers, this path explicitly returns completion bool. Do not alias by shared Result/bool remedy.",
